            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Now with the Seed of Death and the Quintessence of Fear, you can make your Scarecrow. What? You thought I'd just give one to you? Oh no... that wouldn't be appropriate. Each must be crafted by its user.",
