            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "There are a few items you'll need to make your Scarecrow with... wood from the Death Tree in Wizard City for the framework, and some sackcloth from Gloria Krendall.",
